# CTF-01 genuine fixed-CON15 loader helper source proposal

This is an unexecuted, separate production entrypoint. It uses the ordered 15 raw
IDF inputs in the authentic CON scope, not the 39 explicit-member unit models.
No frozen production packet, successful loader outcome, numerical result or PASS
is claimed. Root must review and freeze the actual request/projection/criteria
before this production helper is invoked.

Fresh02 preserves the unexecuted01 proposal and repairs its constant-init order.
The helper constructs fresh EnergyPlusData and installs I/O sinks per input.
Actual InputProcessor::processInput reads the original IDF, followed by actual
PostIPProcessing, init_constant_state and whole init_state once in that order.
The latter genuinely calls GetProjectData and ProcessScheduleInput; the helper
does not call those two methods again. Constants are not initialized in Factory.
The separate constant_initialization record is an exact copy of lifecycle phase3,
including actual not-invoked status if construction, parsing or PostIP stopped.
TimeStepsInHour, MinutesInTimeStep, TimeStepZone and TimeStepZoneSec are copied from
the source-produced owners and checked against the declared 4/15/0.25/900 caller.
No timestep field is overwritten. The production admission requires that exact
caller and does not infer it from Native or Rust observations.

The thirteen fixed phase records are, in order:

1. InputProcessor::processInput.
2. SimulationManager::PostIPProcessing.
3. EnergyPlusData::init_constant_state.
4. EnergyPlusData::init_state.
5. OutputReportPredefined::SetPredefinedTables.
6. HeatBalanceManager::SetPreConstructionInputParameters.
7. OutputProcessor::SetupTimePointers for the actual Zone timestep owner.
8. OutputProcessor::SetupTimePointers for the actual System timestep owner.
9. HeatBalanceManager::GetProjectControlData.
10. HeatBalanceManager::GetSiteAtmosphereData.
11. Material::GetMaterialData.
12. HeatBalanceManager::GetConstructData.
13. HeatBalanceManager::GetBuildingData.


